  "content": "\n\t\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-rowlayout alignnone\"><div id=\"kt-layout-id_a5b8a9-28\" class=\"kt-row-layout-inner kt-layout-id_a5b8a9-28\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-gutter-wider kt-v-gutter-default kt-row-valign-middle kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-m-colapse-left-to-right kt-mobile-layout-row\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column inner-column-1 kadence-column_7230c7-1d\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20251011091829im_/https://unveilingwithme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/WhatsApp-Image-2023-01-18-at-11.11.52-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-193\"></figure>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column inner-column-2 kadence-column_3364e8-46\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\">\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Hi! I’m Ibukun. </strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Welcome to “Unveiling with Me,” a platform where we shine the light of Jesus.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A life yet to be lived is devoid of colour. However, with conception, the journey begins, unveiling a spectrum of hues. For some, a pervasive gloom overshadows their experiences. They grow weary trying to morph into brighter, more radiant versions of themselves. But how bright may darkness be? </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Some continue to mask their true selves, maintaining a façade that ultimately shows that deep darkness doesn’t transform into light but only into varying shades of darkness. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Conversely, another group of people light up their space.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Join me on a captivating journey of unveiling. Here, we don’t hide the darkness or try to make it seem appealing. Instead, we strip away the shadows to let the light shine through. We reveal the light of Christ within!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This site is for you if you belong to any of the categories of people below:&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-iconlist kt-svg-icon-list-items kt-svg-icon-list-items_4947d9-92 kt-svg-icon-list-columns-1 alignnone\"><ul class=\"kt-svg-icon-list\"><li class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-style-default kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap kt-svg-icon-list-item-0 kt-svg-icon-list-level-0\"><div style=\"display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center\" class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-single kt-svg-icon-list-single-fe_checkCircle\"><svg style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"></polyline></svg></div><span class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-text\">You’re having difficulty expressing yourself</span></li><li class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-style-default kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap kt-svg-icon-list-item-1 kt-svg-icon-list-level-0\"><div style=\"display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center\" class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-single kt-svg-icon-list-single-fe_checkCircle\"><svg style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"></polyline></svg></div><span class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-text\">You are yearning to expand your understanding of God&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-style-default kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap kt-svg-icon-list-item-2 kt-svg-icon-list-level-0\"><div style=\"display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center\" class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-single kt-svg-icon-list-single-fe_checkCircle\"><svg style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"></polyline></svg></div><span class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-text\">You love great stories</span></li><li class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-style-default kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap kt-svg-icon-list-item-3 kt-svg-icon-list-level-0\"><div style=\"display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center\" class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-single kt-svg-icon-list-single-fe_checkCircle\"><svg style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"></polyline></svg></div><span class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-text\">You enjoy laughing</span></li><li class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-style-default kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap kt-svg-icon-list-item-4 kt-svg-icon-list-level-0\"><div style=\"display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center\" class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-single kt-svg-icon-list-single-fe_checkCircle\"><svg style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"></polyline></svg></div><span class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-text\">You are growing and learning more about shining for Christ</span></li></ul></div>\n\n\n\n<p>I love sharing authentic experiences about faith, family, hobbies, parenting, and relationships. If you’re looking to relax after a long day, grab a snack and explore my page; you’ll find it well worth your time.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>“<em>Ye are the light of the world. A city that is set on a hill cannot be hid.” </em><strong>Matthew 5:14 KJV</strong></p>\n</div></div>\n</div></div></div>\n"
